I have never seen a temple outside of the pregenerated ones, but I've 
heard they're possible. I usually find another altar before Medusa, but 
not always. One time I found 4 altars within the first 5 dungeon levels...

You will always find a temple in minetown, and another in the Valley of 
the Dead. I rarely can afford more than two protection buys from the 
minetown priest (kill the shopkeeps [not Izchak] or have you pet do it 
to help afford it). If I make it to the VotD, I'll have saved up enough 
for another 8+ purchases, usually. Especially if I make an effort to get 
all of the gold available.

If the minetown altar is the first I've seen even after doing sokoban, 
I'll usually convert it. Being able to sacrifice is more important to me 
than the protection at that point.

